  "bodyHash": "fe5a09bc276c1f82",
  "content": "\n\n<p>这个小型 Fabric 模组为你的狼添加了可装备的护甲。下界合金甲能够抵挡火焰伤害。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>装备护甲请右键点击你驯服的狼。若要卸下，请空手按住 Shift 键右键点击该狼。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>可用附魔：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>全部保护类附魔</li>\n<li>耐久</li>\n<li>经验修补</li>\n<li>荆棘</li>\n<li>灵魂疾行</li>\n</ul>\n<p>护甲拥有耐久度，最终会损坏。但可在配置文件中关闭此功能。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/yJem17U.png\" alt=\"狼\" width=\"847\" height=\"450\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/VhifIt3.png\" alt=\"颜色\" width=\"843\" height=\"205\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/lTJVuXE.png\" alt=\"合成\" width=\"600\" height=\"335\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/JM0dAuB.png\" alt=\"升级\" width=\"569\" height=\"324\"></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
